/T (On the backend, FastAPI is used to facilitate communication between the frontend and the AI models. FastAPI also manages the processing requests for images, executes machine learning inference and then returns the results efficiently. Additionally, a PostgreSQL database is utilized to store system data such as field data, detection results and historical data. This allows users to track their detection activity over time, analyze trends, and provide a structured repository to hold their agricultural data. The modular architecture of the system allows it to expand into new areas, such as real-time monitoring, integrating sensor data from farm machinery and predictive analytics.)
/E (On the backend, FastAPI is used to facilitate communication between the frontend and the AI models. FastAPI also manages the processing requests for images, executes machine learning inference and then returns the results efficiently. Additionally, a PostgreSQL database is utilized to store system data such as field data, detection results and historical data. This allows users to track their detection activity over time, analyze trends, and provide a structured repository to hold their agricultural data. The modular architecture of the system allows it to expand into new areas, such as real-time monitoring, integrating sensor data from farm machinery and predictive analytics.)
