/T (While AgriDrone AI enhances efficiency, it also encourages precision agriculture, with decisions made based on reliable timely data instead of assumptions. The system alleviates the need for manual inspection by minimizing time and labor while providing more accurate observations. Through this technology, farmers are able to survey vast tracts of land rapidly; identify areas requiring attention; allocate resources appropriately based on the level of need; identify early symptoms of disease help mitigate crop failure and reduce the use of unnecessary amounts of pesticides, therefore re-enforcing sustainable farming practices.)
/E (While AgriDrone AI enhances efficiency, it also encourages precision agriculture, with decisions made based on reliable timely data instead of assumptions. The system alleviates the need for manual inspection by minimizing time and labor while providing more accurate observations. Through this technology, farmers are able to survey vast tracts of land rapidly; identify areas requiring attention; allocate resources appropriately based on the level of need; identify early symptoms of disease help mitigate crop failure and reduce the use of unnecessary amounts of pesticides, therefore re-enforcing sustainable farming practices.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [9]
