/T (In addition, the system establishes a strong basis for future smart agricultural advancements. At present, the drones are operated manually, and the architectural design reflects a future transition toward the use of autonomous drones, coordination amongst multiple drones, and analysis of video feeds as they are being transmitted in real-time. Future enhancements of the system will include integrating IoT \(Internet of Things\) sensors to provide environmental monitoring of soil moisture, temperature, humidity, etc. and thereby provide a greater comprehensive picture of current field conditions. Lastly, the incorporation of advanced analytics along with machine-learning models will enable predicting yields, identifying nutrient deficiencies, and developing optimal farming strategies.)
/E (In addition, the system establishes a strong basis for future smart agricultural advancements. At present, the drones are operated manually, and the architectural design reflects a future transition toward the use of autonomous drones, coordination amongst multiple drones, and analysis of video feeds as they are being transmitted in real-time. Future enhancements of the system will include integrating IoT \(Internet of Things\) sensors to provide environmental monitoring of soil moisture, temperature, humidity, etc. and thereby provide a greater comprehensive picture of current field conditions. Lastly, the incorporation of advanced analytics along with machine-learning models will enable predicting yields, identifying nutrient deficiencies, and developing optimal farming strategies.)
