391 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 203 0 R
/E (Food security relies heavily on agriculture, but agriculture still suffers from problems related to inefficient management and monitoring. Current traditional methods of monitoring agriculture use manual inspection so that farmers physically check the health of plants, identify illnesses, and assess the conditions of their fields. Unfortunately, although the farmers have relied on this method for decades, it is often labor-intensive, takes a lot of time, and is inaccurate - especially for larger areas of land. )
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
392 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 203 0 R
/E <>
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
393 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 203 0 R
/E (However, there is hope for the agricultural community due to the advancement of new technologies, including AI, computer vision, and drones. With these technologies, the agricultural community will get an opportunity to transform how they manage their farms as well as their environmental impact on producing food locally and globally. High-resolution aerial images of agricultural fields can be taken quickly using drones with cameras. This aerial imagery of crop health, disease presence and field structure can help with large-scale data collection when combined with AI-based image analysis techniques.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
394 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 203 0 R
/E (There is currently no integrated solution that combines all three components \(aerial data acquisition, intelligent analysis, and user-friendly visualization\) into one system. Most of the solutions available today either only collect data, or offer limited analysis capabilities without being implemented in real-world agricultural applications.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
395 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 203 0 R
/E (Thus, there is a significant need for an automated, intelligent, scalable and cost effective solution that can leverage drone technology and AI to enhance agricultural monitoring. The solution must also automate data collection, provide accurate analyses and actionable insights through a user-friendly interface. AgriDrone AI will provide a solution to the challenges above by developing a drone-based AI agricultural monitoring system that will accomplish the detection of crops diseasing and identify field boundaries.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
