/P 204 0 R
/T (Similar advancements in edge detection and image segmentation, such as the DexiNed edge-detection model \(Dense Extreme Inception Network for Edge Detection\), have led to improved precision when determining boundaries and other structures in images and will also enable more accurate identification of the field boundaries, the segmentation of fields, and estimation of land areas from aerial images for the purpose of facilitating efficient farm management and planning.)
/E (Similar advancements in edge detection and image segmentation, such as the DexiNed edge-detection model \(Dense Extreme Inception Network for Edge Detection\), have led to improved precision when determining boundaries and other structures in images and will also enable more accurate identification of the field boundaries, the segmentation of fields, and estimation of land areas from aerial images for the purpose of facilitating efficient farm management and planning.)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
401 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 204 0 R
/T (At the same time, technological advancements have led to a rapid evolution of drone technology, which has become cost-effective and easily accessible and has become a viable tool for obtaining high-resolution aerial imagery for large-scale agricultural applications. Drones in agriculture can fly across large areas in much less time than is needed for manual inspections, making them excellent tools for data collection in precision agriculture.)
/E (At the same time, technological advancements have led to a rapid evolution of drone technology, which has become cost-effective and easily accessible and has become a viable tool for obtaining high-resolution aerial imagery for large-scale agricultural applications. Drones in agriculture can fly across large areas in much less time than is needed for manual inspections, making them excellent tools for data collection in precision agriculture.)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
