/S /P
/P 204 0 R
/E (Despite advancements in technology, there remain some unresolved issues with current agricultural data solutions:)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
403 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1109 0 R
/E (Many of the existing systems that are available today have not fully integrated all their data together into one system, which requires farmers to use many different computer programs to collect, process and visualize their data.)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [6]
>>
