/P 205 0 R
/E (One of the main motivators behind accurate identification of property lines is to better understand how land is divided into smaller plots as well as measuring the respective area of each plot for better management of resources, irrigation and estimating potential yield. Presently, the methods used in measuring land are typically inefficient and not very accurate; even more importantly when dealing with larger plots of land or oddly shaped plots.)
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [2]
>>
