413 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 205 0 R
/E (Along with the benefits of accurate identification of property boundaries there is also the fact that there is a growing demand for agricultural products to be produced digitally; more specific to these trusted brands, there is an increase in the need for utilities that facilitate these activities such as precision farming and smart agriculture. Worldwide the government and organizations are working together to increase the use of technology in farming to help increase the quality of the product while increasing the quantity of the product produced for sells; this system was designed to assist in respecting these goals by being an easy and effective, yet cost effective way of using AI, Digital Technology, as well as drones within our daily farming tasks.)
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [3]
>>
