437 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 207 0 R
/T (The image capture portion of the system begins when the drone is used to acquire images of agriculture using the camera and is flown using manual controls by the operator. Images must be acquired from multiple positions and ranges and the system is designed to allow for efficient coverage of large areas with uploaded images after collection. Image quality is a critical aspect of the AI predictive modelling since image accuracy is based on lighting, altitude and the angle of the camera \(to the earth\).)
/E (The image capture portion of the system begins when the drone is used to acquire images of agriculture using the camera and is flown using manual controls by the operator. Images must be acquired from multiple positions and ranges and the system is designed to allow for efficient coverage of large areas with uploaded images after collection. Image quality is a critical aspect of the AI predictive modelling since image accuracy is based on lighting, altitude and the angle of the camera \(to the earth\).)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [6]
>>
