441 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 207 0 R
/E (FastAPI is the framework used to create the back end of the system. It serves as the main processing unit \(the back end\) of the system, where image data is received from the front end, routed to the proper AI pipelines, and ultimately returned as answers after model loading and AI inference processing. The back end manages how different parts of the application communicate with one another and how each part of the application can handle many separate requests yet achieve high levels of performance.)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
442 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1125 0 R
/E (The Plant Disease Detection module)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
443 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 207 0 R
/E (It is designed to assess crops for signs of disease. Using a YOLO-based model, this module identifies and isolates the leaf areas from the images; once isolated, additional processing is performed using RGB or HSV filtering and contrast enhancement. After the processing, the image will be sent to a convolutional neural network that can classify the plant as either healthy or diseased, as well as return with a corresponding confidence level regarding its determination. The result of this analysis is then passed back to the frontend for display purposes.)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
