/P 208 0 R
/T (The Front End will be created using Next.js and React, with an interactive and user-friendly interface that enables Users to upload Images, run detection processes, and visualize their results in a structured format. The visual results of the analysis will include Segmented Maps of Fields and results of disease detection, making it easier for the User to understand and comprehend the analysis. Other important metrics, such as Confidence Scores of detection, Number of Plots analyzed, and Area sizes, will be available on the User's interface.)
/E (The Front End will be created using Next.js and React, with an interactive and user-friendly interface that enables Users to upload Images, run detection processes, and visualize their results in a structured format. The visual results of the analysis will include Segmented Maps of Fields and results of disease detection, making it easier for the User to understand and comprehend the analysis. Other important metrics, such as Confidence Scores of detection, Number of Plots analyzed, and Area sizes, will be available on the User's interface.)
