/P 1153 0 R
/E (The overall success and operation of the entire AgriDrone AI system will depend heavily upon the quality of the photos that have been collected. Higher quality \(resolution, lighting\) and more accurately framed images will produce the best possible results in relation to disease detection and boundary segmenting of the crop area being monitored. Conversely, lower-quality images will result in poorer quality predictions and decrease the reliability of the overall AgriDrone AI system.)
/Pg 33 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
