/P 211 0 R
/T (The identified leaf areas will also be preprocessed to assist with improving Image Quality. Many techniques can be used, but CLAHE \(Contrast Limited Adaptive Histogram Equalization\) may be the best suited for enhancing the visibility and contrast of leaf areas, since lighting can vary greatly from day to day.)
/E (The identified leaf areas will also be preprocessed to assist with improving Image Quality. Many techniques can be used, but CLAHE \(Contrast Limited Adaptive Histogram Equalization\) may be the best suited for enhancing the visibility and contrast of leaf areas, since lighting can vary greatly from day to day.)
/Pg 33 0 R
/K [12]
>>
