529 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 213 0 R
/E (The boundary edge detection process is accomplished using DexiNed \(Dense Extreme Inception Network for Edge Detection\). DexiNed is a new state of the art Deep Learning model which can accurately identify and delineate complex and fine edgemarks in an image. DexiNed identifies boundaries in images of separated areas by identifying edges, these edges would be identified as the points between individual crops, points on irrigated lines, and the edge where there is an output difference in image brightness from soil to crop.)
/Pg 35 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
