646 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 219 0 R
/E (The Diagnostic interface contains multiple sections \(diagnostic area\) including the image display section, the telemetry section, and the summary of diagnostics area, respectively. The telemetry section of the interface provides information about the data used by the AgriDrone AI system to make the classification of crop health, which includes processing data and overall calibration \(status\) of the system. The summary of diagnostics area contains classifications that are unique to a specific type of crop or crop disease and potentially lists options for diagnosing an incorrect classification \(i.e., whether a crop is diseased\).)
/Pg 41 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
647 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 219 0 R
/E (The output section from the AgriDrone AI system lists the classification result and corresponding confidence level percentages, which indicate how reliable the classification was in determining whether the analysed crops were healthy or diseased. The clean presentation of elements in the output section was designed to enhance user experience and will provide an efficient means for the users to interpret their outcomes.)
/Pg 41 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
648 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 219 0 R
