/Title (AgriDrone AI has many advantages, such as lessening the amount of time needed for agricultural work, speeding up the process of analyzing large areas of agriculture, and increasing the accuracy of identifying crop disease and the boundaries of fields. That would also provide farmers and other stakeholders with real-time data and analysis in order to make better decisions about their crops and other agricultural products, which is part of precision agriculture. While the current system uses manual aerial imagery processed through drones, it is designed to be scalable, allowing for future implementation of features like autonomous drone navigation, video analysis in real-time, Internet of Things \(IoT\)-based environmental monitoring through sensors embedded in various pieces of equipment, and predictive data models.)
/Dest [16 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 2051 0 R
/Next 2177 0 R
>>
endobj
2174 0 obj
<<
/Title (Overall, these future enhancements will transform AgriDrone AI into a comprehensive precision agriculture platform capable of delivering real-time monitoring, predictive insights, and intelligent decision support, ultimately improving productivity and sustainability in agriculture.)
/Dest [50 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 2178 0 R
/Next 2052 0 R
>>
endobj
