/Title (In conclusion, AgriDrone AI is a smart agricultural approach that includes data acquisition through drones, data analysis conducted through artificial intelligence, and digital/user-friendly interfaces that help improve how agriculture is monitored today and provide the basis for future development of smart agriculture solutions, leading to improved productivity, sustainable production methods, and a more resilient agriculture industry.)
/Dest [16 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 2173 0 R
/Next 2179 0 R
>>
endobj
