2181 0 obj
<<
/Title (The second area of focus for this system is the detection of field boundaries and segmentation of the different parts of agricultural fields. There are many times that an agriculture field is split up into various different areas \(plots\) that all have different uses, but all relate to agriculture, such as rotational crops, irrigation systems, or test plots. It takes a lot of time and is very hard to identify and measure these plots manually. To identify and measure the field boundary, the AgriDrone AI system uses edge detection technologies with advanced models including DexiNed, to detect where the boundaries of differing regions are located in an aerial image. Once the boundary has been detected, the images of the boundaries will be viewed and processed using segmentation algorithms to break up the entire field into individual plots. Using geometric calculations the system will provide an estimation of the area of each plot to allow for accurate measurements of the plots that can be used for planning and monitoring and optimization of the agricultural activity.)
/Dest [18 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 2179 0 R
/Next 2183 0 R
>>
endobj
