2241 0 obj
<<
/Title (Tm et al. [11] demonstrated a CNN-SVM hybrid architecture achieving 95.48% accuracy on a rice disease dataset, highlighting that combining deep feature extraction with classical classification heads can yield competitive accuracy on small, domain-specific datasets where pure end-to-end CNNs may overfit. This finding is relevant to the PlantDiseaseCNN component of AgriDrone, which employs transfer learning from an ImageNet-pretrained backbone to compensate for limited labeled agricultural training data in field collection scenarios.)
/Dest [22 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 2238 0 R
/Next 2243 0 R
>>
endobj
