/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 2244 0 R
/Next 2239 0 R
>>
endobj
2243 0 obj
<<
/Title (Rangarajan et al. [12] applied AlexNet and VGG16 transfer learning to tomato disease classification, achieving 91.2% accuracy and demonstrating that deeper pre-trained architectures provide diminishing returns beyond VGG-depth for single-crop disease classification tasks. The DexiNed component of the AgriDrone AI pipeline serves a fundamentally different function from disease classification: it performs dense edge detection for field boundary delineation in the aerial imagery, enabling the system to segment treatment zones and calculate affected area in square meters for the plant_detections schema's affected_area_sqm field.)
/Dest [22 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 2241 0 R
/Next 2245 0 R
>>
endobj
