>>
endobj
2245 0 obj
<<
/Title (DeChant et al. [13] achieved 96.7% classification accuracy for Northern Leaf Blight on in-field maize imagery using a custom CNN, representing one of the strongest validations of CNN-based disease detection in true field conditions rather than controlled settings. Their work was limited, however, to a single disease and single crop type, with no cloud deployment infrastructure. The AgriDrone AI platform targets multi-crop, multi-disease generalization through its modular model architecture, where the YOLO leaf detector and disease classifier can be independently retrained and hot-swapped via the Python FastAPI model management layer without interrupting the frontend dashboard or database services.)
/Dest [22 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 2243 0 R
/Next 2247 0 R
>>
