/Title (A hardware system is important as it is the foundation of AgriDrone AI. The drone uses an S500 frame, 935KV brushless motors, 1045 propellers, 35A ESC's and Pixhawk 2.4.8 flight controller to provide stability, control and manoeuvrability for flight. The M8N GPS module provides location to track, the T10 transmitter and R10 receiver provide manual control of the drone, and the camera on board allows for remote capture of image data to feed into one AI.)
