2277 0 obj
<<
/Title (With the new system, users will gain real-time access to accurate and efficient agricultural monitoring data. By combining drone technology and artificial intelligence, we will help farmers adapt their traditional farming methods to more data-driven and intelligent practices.)
/Dest [28 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 2283 0 R
/Next 2272 0 R
>>
endobj
2278 0 obj
<<
/Title (Image Acquisition Process)
/Dest [29 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2273 0 R
>>
endobj
2279 0 obj
<<
/Title (Frontend & User Interface)
/Dest [30 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2274 0 R
>>
endobj
2280 0 obj
<<
/Title <>
/Dest [26 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2276 0 R
/Next 2284 0 R
>>
endobj
2281 0 obj
<<
/Title (At the same time, technological advancements have led to a rapid evolution of drone technology, which has become cost-effective and easily accessible and has become a viable tool for obtaining high-resolution aerial imagery for large-scale agricultural applications. Drones in agriculture can fly across large areas in much less time than is needed for manual inspections, making them excellent tools for data collection in precision agriculture.)
/Dest [26 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2276 0 R
/Prev 2284 0 R
>>
endobj
2282 0 obj
<<
/Title (3.3 PROBLEM DEFINITION)
/Dest [27 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 2276 0 R
/Next 2285 0 R
>>
endobj
2283 0 obj
<<
/Title (This project has developed an AI-based drone platform for precision agriculture that combines different functions into one solution. The platform will use computer vision to identify and segment crop disease and will feature an online dashboard for data visualization and analysis.)
/Dest [28 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 2286 0 R
/Next 2277 0 R
>>
endobj
2284 0 obj
<<
/Title (Similar advancements in edge detection and image segmentation, such as the DexiNed edge-detection model \(Dense Extreme Inception Network for Edge Detection\), have led to improved precision when determining boundaries and other structures in images and will also enable more accurate identification of the field boundaries, the segmentation of fields, and estimation of land areas from aerial images for the purpose of facilitating efficient farm management and planning.)
/Dest [26 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2276 0 R
/Prev 2280 0 R
/Next 2281 0 R
>>
endobj
2285 0 obj
<<
/Title (There also aren't any easy-to-use interfaces for users to visualize or analyze their raw agricultural data. When users don't have the right platform, even accurate data will not help them make decisions.)
/Dest [28 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 2282 0 R
/Next 2287 0 R
>>
endobj
2286 0 obj
<<
/Title (The need for a cost-effective, user-friendly solution for use in agriculture.)
/Dest [28 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 2288 0 R
/Next 2283 0 R
>>
endobj
2287 0 obj
<<
/Title (In light of these limitations, this project will solve four major problems:)
/Dest [28 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 2285 0 R
/Next 2289 0 R
>>
endobj
2288 0 obj
<<
/Title (The need for integrated platforms for data acquisition, processing, and visualization that work well.)
/Dest [28 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 2290 0 R
/Next 2286 0 R
>>
endobj
2289 0 obj
<<
/Title (The need for a highly efficient and scalable monitoring method.)
/Dest [28 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 2287 0 R
